{
  "name": "pi-zero",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "pi-zero \u2014 the pi door to Skill Zero: floor/product-floor/curated/native posture launcher built on pi's --no-skills / --skill primitives. Built on skill-zero core. PROTOTYPE (WS5).",
